Code in this repository that is not covered by the licence above
---------------------------------------------------------------

These files keep their own copyright notices and licences (see the top of
each file):

- drivers/net/wireless/intel/iwlwifi/ — Intel's Wi-Fi driver, from Linux.
  Copyright Intel Corporation and others. "GPL-2.0 OR BSD-3-Clause": MyOS
  uses it under BSD-3-Clause.
- include/linux/ieee80211.h, include/net/cfg80211.h, include/net/mac80211.h,
  include/net/ieee80211_radiotap.h, include/net/regulatory.h,
  include/uapi/linux/nl80211.h — Linux's wireless headers, under the
  permissive licences stated in each file.

WritePerfect (live/writeperfect/) is a separate project by Rodger Wilson:
Copyright (c) 2026 Rodger Wilson. All rights reserved. It is not covered by
the BSD licence above.

The live disk images MyOS builds also contain Alpine Linux packages, each
under its own licence; they are downloaded at build time, not kept here.
